MILKDROP HELP

PLAYBACK
Z Previous track
X Play
C Play/Pause
Space Pause
V Stop
B Next track
Up/Down Volume
Left/Right Seek 5s
Shift+Left/Right 30s
U / Shift+U Shuffle
P Playlist
Mouse wheel Volume
Single click Play/Pause

MESSAGES / SPRITES
T Song title animation
Y Custom message mode
K Sprite mode
Ctrl+T/Y Clear text
Ctrl+K Kill all sprites
Del Newest sprite
Shift+Del Oldest
---RIGHT---
VISUALS
Alt+Enter Fullscreen
Double-click Fullscreen
Esc Help/fullscreen off
H Hard cut next preset
Backspace Previous preset
R Random/sequential
L Load preset
Scroll Lock Lock preset
+/- Rate preset
F2 Song title
F3 Song time
F4 Preset name
F5 FPS
F6 Rating
F8 Change preset dir
F9 Shader help

PRESET TWEAKS
I Zoom in/out
W Waveform next/prev
J Waveform size
E Wave opacity
G Gamma
Q Echo zoom (MD1)
F Echo flip (MD1)
